' Run test: tfdesign, the visual designer, on designer.files/sample.bas.
' It moves cmdOK by dragging and sizes it with Shift+Right; places a
' Frame and a CheckBox inside it from the Toolbox; drags lblName into the
' Frame, undoes that and redoes it; sets txtName's Text in the property
' sheet; double-clicks the CheckBox (writing chk1_Click into sample.bas);
' sets the tab order with F6 (cmdOK, then txtName); and saves.
Name=tfdesign
Startup=Sub Main
Form=../../designer/window.bas
Module=../../designer/designer.bas
Module=../../designer/model.bas
Module=../../designer/catalog.bas
Module=../../designer/files.bas
